there. But what they find is not riches or jewels; it is a strange girl lying asleep in a coffin at the bottom of the sea, Atri. Atri is a robot, but her appearance and her wealth of emotions would fool anyone into thinking she's a living, breathing human being. In gratitude for being salvaged, she makes a declaration to Natsuki.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Environmental","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Lost Civilization","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":44,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyberpunk","rank":36,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":35,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"ATRI -My Dear Moments-","english":"ATRI -My Dear Moments-","native":"ATRI -My Dear Moments-","romaji":"ATRI: My Dear Moments","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"亚托莉 -我挚爱的时光-"}]},"trailer":{"id":"3P2OQ-VnNzM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3P2OQ-VnNzM/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}